    "description": "A small, SLeeLa-authored seed vocabulary for the whitespace tokenizer primitive: reserved special tokens at fixed low IDs, then digits, common punctuation and symbols, closed-class English function words, and a compact core of open-class words. It is a token-ID table only (no definitions), deliberately original so it carries no third-party licensing obligations, and is meant to be extended by the corpus->tokenizer builder. It is not a production BPE/WordPiece model.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "name": "SLeeLa project (original authorship)",
        "license": "CC0-1.0",
        "note": "Token strings are ordinary English orthography and a hand-curated closed-class/core list; no third-party vocabulary file was copied."
      }
    ]
